      "summary": "Main-thread executor (Platform or Test variant) that spawns local futures via async_task and reschedules them onto the main thread through the platform delegate; errors if constructed off the main thread.",
      "tags": ["executor", "async", "main-thread", "task-spawning", "local"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
